<iscomment>
    This is a blank template that gets overwritten in rvw_integrations_core
    The overriding template in rvw_integrations_core has integrations specific to this area

    Page Type: Checkout

    It gets called by rvw_autobahn_core:templates/default/checkout/checkout.isml

    Try to keep this template blank as any changes here need to also be carried over to the same template in rvw_integrations_core
</iscomment>

<iscomment>These are the buttons that are referenced in app_storefront_base and are defined here incase there is no credit card integration</iscomment>
<button class="btn btn-primary btn-block submit-shipping" type="submit" name="submit" value="submit-shipping" <isif condition="${pdict.order.usingMultiShipping && !pdict.order.shippable}">disabled</isif> cypress-target="checkoutSubmitShipping">
    ${Resource.msg('button.next.payment', 'checkout', null)}
</button>

<button class="btn btn-primary btn-block submit-payment" type="submit" name="submit" value="submit-payment">
    <isif condition="${dw.system.Site.current.getCustomPreferenceValue('skipReviewStepInCheckout')}">
        ${Resource.msg('button.place.order', 'checkout', null)}
    <iselse>
        ${Resource.msg('button.next.place.order', 'checkout', null)}
    </isif>
</button>

<button class="btn btn-primary btn-block place-order" data-action="${URLUtils.url('CheckoutServices-PlaceOrder')}"
        type="submit" name="submit" value="place-order" cypress-target="checkoutPlaceOrder">${Resource.msg('button.place.order', 'checkout', null)}
</button>
